<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 131-2 V ENGLAND (77) IN SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 131-2 V ENGLAND (77) IN SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 131 for two in</p>
<p>reply to England's first innings score of 77 at close of play on</p>
<p>the</p>
<p>third day of the second test at Lord's on Saturday.</p>
</text>
